														<p class="brfprofile">Prof.(Dr.) Ruchi Rayat is the Executive
															Director & Professor of OB & HR at GIMS. She is Accredited
															Management Expert and comes with a rich experience of more
															than 18 years as an academician and administrator. Her
															academic assets include a Doctoral Degree in Human Resource
															Management, Masters in Management and Graduate Diploma in
															Commerce. She has several publications in national and
															international journals of high repute including Scopus and
															ABDC indexed journals and participated in Faculty
															Development Programmes at reputed places like Indian
															Institute of Management (L), SIMCA, SP Jain Institute of
															Management and Research, Noorul Islam Centre for Higher
															Education, and BIMTECH, among others. Before joining GIMS,
															Dr. Rayat was the Programme Head of BBA Platinum, the
															flagship programme of one of the leading Management
															Institute. She has also acted as an In-charge Professor of
															Incubation Centre to mentor the young students in creating
															their own startups and Chief Editor of the institute
															magazine. She has served as coordinator of several
															committees including Women Grievance Cell, Academic Council,
															Recruitment, Examination, Outreach among others in served
															colleges. She has also been part of the AKTU panel to judge
															events sponsored by the university in different colleges.
														</p>
